    {
      "title": "CJP to launch 'Jail Bharo' protest in Mumbai, seek CEC's removal: Details",
      "link": "https://www.business-standard.com/india-news/cjp-oct-2-protest-cec-gyanesh-kumar-resignation-jantar-mantar-shivaji-park-126100200253_1.html",
      "description": "CJP plans to begin its nationwide agitation from Mumbai's Shivaji Park, demanding Gyanesh Kumar's resignation, a halt to SIR and changes to the Election Commission appointment law",
      "source_name": "Business Standard Latest",
